ty-five thousand."}}},{"verse_id":402833,"page_no":null,"line_no":null,"gurmukhi":"ਚੜੈ੍ਹ ਸਿੰਘ ਤਿਸ ਮੁਕਤ ਕਰਾਊਂ। (੫੯)","translit_en":"chaRaih si(n)gh tis mukat karaauoo(n)| (59)","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"The Sikh proceeding thus, (I will) get emancipated.(59)"}}},{"verse_id":402834,"page_no":null,"line_no":null,"gurmukhi":"ਝੂਲਣ ਨੇਜੇ ਹਸਤੀ ਸਾਜੇ","translit_en":"jhoolan neje hasatee saaje","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"The spears wave and the elephants are decorated,"}}},{"verse_id":402835,"page_no":null,"line_no":null,"gurmukhi":"ਦੁਆਰ ਦੁਆਰ ਪਰ ਨੌਬਤ ਬਾਜੇ। (੬੦)","translit_en":"dhuaar dhuaar par nauabat baaje| (60)","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"At every door the victory drums beat.(60)"}}},{"verse_id":402836,"page_no":null,"line_no":null,"gurmukhi":"ਸਵਾ ਲਾਖ ਜਬ ਧੁਖੈ ਪਲੀਤਾ","translit_en":"savaa laakh jab dhukhai paleetaa","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"When a hundred and twenty-five thousands fire-works sparkle,"}}},{"verse_id":402837,"page_no":null,"line_no":null,"gurmukhi":"ਤਬੈ ਖਾਲਸਾ ਉਦੈ ਅਸਤ ਲੌ ਜੀਤਾ। (੬੧)","translit_en":"tabai khaalasaa udhai asat lau jeetaa| (61)","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Then assume that, Khalsa has attained victory.(61)"}}}],"nav":{"prev":31015,"next":31017}}